# Data layer

- Bootstrap via `bootstrapDatabase()` / app gate before queries
- Prefer repository functions over raw Drizzle in routes
- Default budget / currency live in `settings` row `id = 'default'`
- Optional month overrides live in `monthly_budgets` (`year_month` = `YYYY-MM`)
- Category delete must reassign dependent transactions / recurring rows
- Do not introduce a server database or `DATABASE_URL` for the app UI
- Query keys / invalidation / prefetch live under `src/lib/query/`
